# ── OS / editor ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*~
#*#

# ── Simulation and plotting output ─────────────────────────────────────
*.nc
*.jld2
*.png
*.gif
*.fig
*.mp4

# ── HPC run directories ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# On Casper the working tree IS /glade/work/nguyen/unc-shoals, so these
# output directories sit inside the repo. Listed explicitly (not just by
# file extension) so that logs, .out/.err files and stray artifacts inside
# them stay untracked too.
/nc/
/nc_old/
/out/
/output/
/logs/
/checkpoints/
/sweep_output/
/archive/
/figures/
# /pbs/ holds PBS run artifacts on Casper. NOTE: job scripts you want VERSIONED
# do not belong here -- put them in jobs/, which is tracked. This directory is
# ignored precisely because *.sh and *.pbs are no longer ignored globally, so
# anything dropped in here would otherwise be picked up as source.
/pbs/
/wind_0p*/
/wind_m0p*/
/*_NOWIND_SAVE/
*.o[0-9]*
*.e[0-9]*

# ── Per-machine job settings ───────────────────────────────────────────
# PBS account, notification email and Julia depot. Tracked as .env.example;
# the real file stays local so `git pull` can never conflict with it.
/.env

# ── Third-party MATLAB toolboxes ───────────────────────────────────────
# Installed on Casper under tools/, deliberately not vendored into git.
# A clone anywhere else needs these fetched separately.
/tools/gsw_matlab_v3_06_16/
/tools/cmocean/
/tools/pmkmp/

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# NOTE: *.sh and *.pbs are deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# They were blanket-ignored until Nov 2026, which meant every PBS job
# script and MATLAB launcher was invisible to git — the reason
# src/sweep/submit_wind_fork.pbs and submit_wind_sweep.pbs were never
# committed despite sitting next to a tracked submit_sweep.pbs. Job
# submission and launcher scripts are project source; they must travel
# with the repo or `git pull` on HPC delivers an unrunnable tree.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
